                                        AKS
                                Azure Kubernetes Service
                                         -----------> EKS in AWS

--> AKS is microsoftsmanaged Kubernetes service.
--> it makes it easy to deploy, manage and scale containeried applications without meeding to install
and maintain kubernetes control plane infrastructure yourself. 

                                     
                                Azure Container Registry
                                        --------------> ECR in AWS

--> ACR is a managed private container image registry provided by Microsoft Azure.
--> it is like a docker hub but your org can have its own private registry inside azure.

**ACI** :
--> Azure Container Instance is a service that allows you to run a container directly in 
azure without managing VMs or Clusters.